---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Thank You | Knit it Now Quick Help"
  description="Thank you for booking a Quick Help session."
>
  <section class="thankyou-page">
    <div class="thankyou-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Knit it Now Quick Help</p>
      <h1>Thank you – your payment was received.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Your next step is to complete a quick prep form so I can understand your question before we meet.
      </p>

      <div class="next-step-box">
        <div class="next-step-heading-row">
          <svg
            class="next-step-heading-icon"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5" />
            <path d="M9 18h6" />
            <path d="M10 22h4" />
          </svg>
          <h2>Next Step</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          Take a minute to tell me what’s going on so we can make the most of your 15 minutes together. This takes less than 3 minutes.
        </p>

        <a class="btn-primary kbm-cta-guide" href="/quick-help-intake" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Complete the Quick Prep Form
        </a>
        <p class="next-step-form-note">(Opens in a Google Form)</p>

        <div class="next-step-fallback">
          <h3 class="next-step-fallback-heading">Having trouble with the form?</h3>
          <p class="next-step-fallback-intro">
            If the form doesn’t open or work properly, just email me your answers to these questions before your session:
          </p>
          <ul class="next-step-fallback-list">
            <li>What machine are you using?</li>
            <li>What’s happening (or not happening)?</li>
            <li>What have you tried so far?</li>
            <li>What are you hoping to fix or understand?</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="help-note">
        <p>
          Once you submit it, I’ll review your details so we can jump straight into solving your issue.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .thankyou-page {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 5rem;
  }

  .thankyou-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #52682d;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .next-step-box {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  .next-step-heading-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .next-step-heading-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 1.35rem;
    height: 1.35rem;
    color: #52682d;
  }

  .next-step-box h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .next-step-box > p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #374151;
  }

  .next-step-box .next-step-form-note {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .next-step-fallback {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  }

  .next-step-fallback-heading {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .next-step-fallback-intro {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .next-step-fallback-list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .next-step-fallback-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .next-step-fallback-list li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #52682d;
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    opacity: 0.92;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .help-note {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .thankyou-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>